// The room server's Everglade rooms: the server is the authority (spec
// docs/verse/2026-11-03-everglade-multiplayer-spec.md sections 3.1 and 3.6; GitHub #12705).
// An everglade relay room (room-relay.coax, game "everglade") relays nothing: its seats' frames are
// intents for the room's simulation here, which runs at EG_HZ, and each seat hears the world from it.
// The frames are apps/openagents-web/everglade-wire.coax's (version 3), read and written by its code,
// which the page #loads too:
//   in:  H 3 LOOK CLASS FLAGS NAME   I SEQ KX KY PX PY THETA B HEARD   C SEQ SLOT AX AY AZ TGT
//        E SEQ KIND ID (KIND 5: end what slot ID holds up)   R SEQ   (t MS, the relay's)
//   out: W TICK HZ SEED DAY WEATHER BUDGET   D TICK ACK F PART E;E;...   r SEQ REASON
// D's entries: s (every entity's state, the wire's one replication model: eg_table fills the room's
// table each tick, wire_seat_frame cuts each seat's rows from it), x ID (one gone from your view),
// n (who a seat is, on change), and the events near you (e cast, e hit, e heal, e die, e rebuild).
//
// Each tick: every seat's queued inputs are stepped, one controller step of 1/EG_HZ s each, as many
// as its page's clock has earned (EG_BANK: the steps of time it may be owed, EG_TICK_STEPS at most a
// tick), by the shared movement step on the room's Everglade world
// (everglade-step.coax, everglade-move.coax: the page predicts with the same calls). That step
// lives in other C units, so the host runs it: rm_eg_input hands it a seat's next input and
// rm_eg_moved takes the state back. Then casts that strike now are rolled by the SRD 5e engine
// (apps/openagents-web/everglade5e-room-rules.coax: one battle for the 16 seats), the engine's
// clock moves on, and each tick each seat gets its D frame.

// Split by concern into everglade/server/ (#13267): the records (seat.coax), seats and lifecycle
// (seats.coax), input (input.coax), casts (casts.coax), the tick (tick.coax), what a seat hears (send.coax), v1's town
// (legacy/town.coax) and the checks (room-checks.coax). The game's shared files stay loaded here.
#load "../../../everglade/server/seat.coax";
#load "../../../everglade/server/seats.coax";
#load "../../../everglade/server/input.coax";
#load "../../../everglade/server/casts.coax";
#load "../../../everglade/server/tick.coax";
#load "../../../everglade/server/legacy/town.coax";
#load "../../../everglade/server/send.coax";
#load "../../../everglade/server/room-checks.coax";
